// Wave 1 acceptance: self-target shield ability.
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 40, range: 0.0 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Shield { amount: 50.0 }],
//                            stackings: [Some(StackingMode::Stack)] }
//
// `stacking stack` exercises Wave 1.5#3 stacking-mode lowering — on
// recast, the .sim's ApplyShield does
// `new_shield = agents.shield_hp(t) + a` (additive accumulation),
// which IS stack semantics. Registry-driven stacking dispatch is later
// infrastructure; the binding-check asserts the lowered slot matches
// the .sim's natural additive behavior.

ability ShieldUp {
    target: self
    cooldown: 4s
    hint: defense

    shield 50 stacking stack [DEFENSE: 100]
}
